      "message": "ci(pr-test): collaborators only, own runner label, complete refusal list\n\nReview findings on #1426 and the maintainer's two decisions: the workflow\nrefuses an author without push access, runs on its own runner label with\na private cargo home and sccache dir, refuses nested .cargo/ and xtask/\npaths and lists the diff with --no-renames; actions pinned by SHA, artifact\nretention capped. Reviewer agent, review-prs and AGENTS.md match; decision\nfile records both decisions.\n\nRefs #1420\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
